Schemas for tcsgui's own node descriptions, the files under share/nodes that
say what each node type asks for and how tcsgui draws it.

    node.xsd             a description, written in XML
    node.schema.json     the same, written in YAML

The schemas of the configurations tcsgui edits -- XTCS and YTCS -- are not
here: they are tcslibgs's, in tcslibgs/schema, since every program reads
those formats.

Installed by `make install-data` under $(PREFIX)/share/tcsgui/schema.
